{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321707001:0":{"text":"伊斯坎德修士，这位是白山公国的宫廷侍卫长罗德里戈，他想请你协助筹备瓦勒沙大公和公主的葬礼。","source_cn":"伊斯坎德修士，这位是白山公国的宫廷侍卫长罗德里戈，他想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F6A4BFB8410E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321707002:0":{"text":"艾雅在上。如果方便的话，我想请您前往瓦勒沙城堡，从旁协助。","source_cn":"艾雅在上。如果方便的话，我想请您前往瓦勒沙城堡，从旁协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB963FDC6E85C32C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321707003:0":{"text":"去城堡筹备葬礼？","source_cn":"去城堡筹备葬礼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50217E9856F02DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321707004:0":{"text":"……请原谅我的失礼，我们可能抽不出这么多时间。","source_cn":"……请原谅我的失礼，我们可能抽不出这么多时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD52904FBAD3949B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321707005:0":{"text":"现在白山大教堂内依然残留着大量邪秽之物，当务之急是将它们尽快清除，不能让侍奉艾雅的神圣之地被邪恶玷污。","source_cn":"现在白山大教堂内依然残留着大量邪秽之物，当务之急是将它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB01FD644FAA9E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl