:""},"say:13:1321707011:0":{"text":"他们的本心……","source_cn":"他们的本心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BC1C4F8EA5F76B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321707012:0":{"text":"……我明白了。那就请您告诉我具体的葬礼流程吧。","source_cn":"……我明白了。那就请您告诉我具体的葬礼流程吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5817811B343FED2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321707013:0":{"text":"我曾听说，白山公国的贵族下葬时会使用冰棺。","source_cn":"我曾听说，白山公国的贵族下葬时会使用冰棺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4617BB683402F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321707014:0":{"text":"是的。白山公国实行土葬，平民用松木或柏木棺材，贵族则使用<style=\"highlight\">特制的冰棺</style>。","source_cn":"是的。白山公国实行土葬，平民用松木或柏木棺材，贵族则使...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78E54D018A31AEEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321707015:0":{"text":"冰棺完成后，修道院会提供<style=\"highlight\">永寒油</style>，那是一种被祝圣过的膏油，可以保证冰棺永远不会融化。","source_cn":"冰棺完成后，修道院会提供<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6942F773CB0BFD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321707016:0":{"text":"此外，在挪入冰棺之前，需要先洁净死者的